{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_03_beg","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":6,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_02_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-3","storyName":"音乐室内的光芒","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在海铃的梦境中，海铃刚出狱便遭到了前东家的打手弗朗西斯的追杀，随后她又收到了来自“老爷”的让她加入其家族的邀请。祥子在寻找海铃的途中遇到了弗朗西斯，发觉了蹊跷之处。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_03_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":4,"next":6,"characters":["狱警","激动的犯人","八幡海铃","领头的打手","谨慎的打手","慌张的打手","弗朗西斯","愤怒的打手","好心的老妇人","戴着帽子的少女","丰川祥子","？？？","严肃的打手","苍老的声音","神秘的打手们"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_65_g10_dreamcastlestage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>大雨如泪水一般落下，我只是无垠海水中的一滴。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>独行的夜，不再迷茫。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>我，毋畏恐惧。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":19},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8d/Avg_bg_bg_cellroomC.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":22},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":23,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":25},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_dooropen","volume":"0.4","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狱警","text":"犯人48038，出来。","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的犯人","text":"长官，您有什么吩咐？","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狱警","text":"检查个人物品，有没有遗漏？","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的犯人","text":"没有，东西我都带齐了！","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狱警","text":"沿着走廊往前面走，走到尽头的那个小窗，签个字离开就行了。","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的犯人","text":"好、好的，谢谢长官！","id":33},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":35},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","delay":"1.5","id":36},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"4","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":38},{"type":"text","text":"有力的小跑声在长廊上回荡。","id":39},{"type":"text","text":"而沉闷的皮靴声则一点点向走廊的最深处靠近。","id":40},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_134","duration":"0.7","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_134","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狱警","text":"海铃。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_134.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3","duration":"0.7","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"在。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_134","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狱警","text":"滚吧，今年别让我再看到你。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_134.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"charslot","id":56},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_dooropen","volume":"0.8","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":60},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":61},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"4","id":62},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":63},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":64},{"type":"text","text":"海铃熟练地拿起自己的琴盒，慢悠悠地走出了监狱。","id":65},{"type":"dialog","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"charslot","id":69},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_33_g6_newtown_street.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainlight_loop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":72},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":75},{"type":"text","text":"叙拉古还是和从前一样，用连绵的小雨迎接她的回归。","id":76},{"type":"dialog","id":77},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"3","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_33_g10_smallrestaurant.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":83},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":85},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"0.8","text":"","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头的打手","text":"这条街，还有前后两条街，每家店都派人盯着，绝对不能让她跑了！","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的打手","text":"是！","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"charslot","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":96},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的打手","text":"大哥，北街那边传来消息，她朝这边过来了！","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头的打手","text":"盯紧她，别让她跑了！","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的打手","text":"她......她好像没有要躲的意思。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头的打手","text":"......让其他人都聚过来！","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"charslot","id":115},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_bg_33_g2_srcalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":117},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainlight_loop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":118},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":119},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":120,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":122},{"type":"text","text":"狭窄的胡同里，一群凶神恶煞的打手，正将提着琴盒的少女团团围住。","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头的打手","text":"又见面了......海铃。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头的打手","text":"呵，我一开始还在想，你这种高手，怎么没有一个家族把你纳入麾下。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头的打手","text":"我们家族遭难后，四处打听，才知道你原来是个臭名昭著的“叛徒”。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头的打手","text":"你前后换过十几个名字，在各个家族间来回接活。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"我们的合同里没有写我不能替别人干活。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"而且我早就说过——我只是拿人钱财，替人消灾。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"12","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头的打手","text":"所以你就把我们的机密告诉了对家？！","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3","focus":"m","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......我不懂你在说什么。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头的打手","text":"*哥伦比亚粗口*，别装傻了！自从你来过后，我们的人就不断遭到暗算！","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头的打手","text":"亏我和老大当时那么信任你，还邀请你加入我们！","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"弗朗西斯，我不记得我有做过什么对不起你们的事......","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"哼，是你亏欠的人实在太多，想都想不起来了吧？！","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"老大死了，大家都死了，几百号人现在只剩我们十几个了！","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......什么意思？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"我们一帮兄弟好不容易从哥伦比亚漂泊到这鬼地方，全栽在你一个人手上了！","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"我......","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的打手","text":"别跟她废话了，我们这么多人在这，今天必须给她个教训！","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3","focus":"m","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"我不想和你们起冲突......","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"虽然海铃努力想要通过言语平息冲突，但对方逼近的脚步没有丝毫停下的意思——","id":159},{"type":"text","text":"她不得不放下了拿在手上的琴盒。","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"所有人......跟我上！","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":163},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordexsheath","volume":"1","id":164},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_attack_ready","volume":"0.6","delay":"0.7","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":166},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":170},{"type":"charslot","id":171},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_cg_rainsplash.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":173},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shallowswalk","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"s","id":174},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"s","fadetime":"2.5","id":175},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":176,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好心的老妇人","text":"小姐，不要再往前走了。","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好心的老妇人","text":"那边刚发生了点事，你一个人去不安全。赶紧绕路吧。","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴着帽子的少女","text":"......谢谢提醒。","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"少女并没有理会路人的劝告，而是朝她说的方向继续走去。","id":182},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shallowswalk","volume":"1","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":185},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":188},{"type":"image","id":189},{"type":"charslot","id":190},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_bg_33_g2_srcalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":192},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"雨淅淅沥沥地下着，冲刷着叙拉古的一切。","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"少女走进小巷，这里干干净净，仿佛是刚建好一样，一尘不染。","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"叙拉古的清洁工总是这么专业。","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"潮湿的空气中，闻不到一丝血的气味。","id":198},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$3","duration":"1","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"海铃......你在哪里？","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$3","focus":"n","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你在......找海铃吗？","id":206},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":209},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":214},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"charslot","id":219},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_bg_33_g11_mansionhall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"text","text":"一座娱乐场里的台球室。没有人会想到，有人将它当作自己的住所。","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"几个纸箱简单地拼成了一张床，最基本的生活用品全被塞进了快餐店赠送的袋子里。","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openenvelope_slow","volume":"1","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":228},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_coin","id":229},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_coin","loop":"false","channel":"coin2","delay":"0.6","id":230},{"type":"text","text":"台球桌上摆满了信封，里面装着海铃的酬劳。","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"海铃一一拆开这些信封，将里面的金币随手扔在桌上，一枚枚印刻着“家族”“秩序”的金币很快堆成了一座小山。","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"这些金币就这样被随意地放在毫无保护的地方，就算丢了，她也一点都不会心疼。","id":233},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_papertear","volume":"1","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......嗯？","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"text","text":"海铃再次确认了一遍——这封信里什么都没有。","id":241},{"type":"text","text":"她将信封翻了过来，上面印着一枚家族徽记，还有一个寄件地址。","id":242},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_33_g7_reception.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的打手","text":"老爷，她来了。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":253},{"type":"charslot","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":255},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"nw","id":256},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"nw","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3","duration":"1","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3","focus":"n","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"监狱里的那些人，没找你麻烦吧？","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#11$3","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"都是老熟人了，更何况，他们都知道我背后的雇主是谁，何必找不痛快。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-11$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"不过老爷特地把我叫来，恐怕不只是为了问我这种小事吧？","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3","focus":"n","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"呵呵，就是单纯关心一下合作伙伴。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"老爷，我们什么时候成合作伙伴了？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"我们之前签订合同时，你甚至不愿意以你家族的名义委托我。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3","focus":"n","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"既然想成为“合作伙伴”，从现在起当然要开诚布公——","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"海铃，我想和你做笔长期生意。","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"什么生意必须当面谈？","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3","focus":"n","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"我想——邀请你加入我的家族。","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#6$3","focus":"m","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"你说......什么？","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":281},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":282},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":283},{"type":"charslot","id":284},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_bg_33_g11_mansionhall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":286},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","volume":"0.6","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":290},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","duration":"1","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"里面没人。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"charslot","id":297},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你明明那么怕她，为什么还要跟过来？","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"你不是家族成员，当然不懂！我必须......替大家报仇雪恨！","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你们和海铃之间到底发生过什么事，她那么不可饶恕吗？","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"你如果经历过这种“背叛”，一定也不会原谅她......","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"我们家族大部分成员都是从哥伦比亚拓荒区逃难至此的普通人，缺少人脉和资源，所以经常会遭到各种本地帮派的挤对。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"这种情况持续了很多年，直到有一天，老大花重金请来了一个打手。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那个人是海铃？","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"嗯。雇佣她以后，我们度过了很长一段时间的安稳日子。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"那段日子真的很美好，再也不用担心据点突然被人偷袭，也不用担心有人上门来找麻烦......","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"但我们邀请她加入我们家族时，她却拒绝了，而且第二天她整个人还直接消失了。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"正当我们觉得疑惑的时候，不知道谁引来的对家打手，偷袭了我们的据点。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"那场面我至今都不愿回想......实在太惨了！","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你觉得是海铃出卖了你们？","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"除了她还能是谁，哪有这么巧合的事情？！","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......我不相信海铃会做出这种背信弃义的事。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我认识的海铃，和你说的一样，能力强大，令人安心。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"而且会对自己加入的组织尽职尽责。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"可是，事实就摆在我面前......","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你有在那帮偷袭你的人中，看见她的身影吗？","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"......没有。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那你还记得那些偷袭者的面貌吗？","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"一辈子都忘不了。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":337},{"type":"charslot","id":338},{"type":"text","text":"祥子深吸了一口气，将手伸向了口袋里的防身武器。","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"如果......是有人故意离间你们呢？","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"如果......是有人一直在监视海铃呢？","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"......你这是什么意思？","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"charslot","id":346},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":348},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_opencabinet","volume":"0.8","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_drawer","volume":"1","delay":"0.3","id":350},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_opencabinet","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"k","delay":"0.5","id":351},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":353},{"type":"text","text":"弗朗西斯还没反应过来，四周的柜门突然全部被推开。","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"每个柜子里都站着一个身形魁梧的打手，他们手里拿着武器，一齐指向房间中央的两人。","id":355},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":359},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gunequip","volume":"0.7","id":360},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gunload","volume":"0.9","delay":"0.2","id":361},{"type":"playsound","key":"$shotgunreload","volume":"1","delay":"0.4","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gunequip","channel":"1","volume":"0.3","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的打手们","text":"不许动。","id":366},{"type":"dialog","id":367},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"charslot","id":370},{"type":"image","id":371}],"characters":["狱警","激动的犯人","八幡海铃","领头的打手","谨慎的打手","慌张的打手","弗朗西斯","愤怒的打手","好心的老妇人","戴着帽子的少女","丰川祥子","？？？","严肃的打手","苍老的声音","神秘的打手们"]}